<title>HONG KONG: Sino Land buys Yuen Long site at auction.</title>
<headline>Sino Land buys Yuen Long site at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sino Land Co Ltd was the buyer of the Yuen Long site sold for HK$370 million at a Hong Kong government land auction on Wednesday, the auctioneer said.</p>
</text>
